  <!-- EN: Tarisian ale is an extremely strong alcoholic beverage brewed on the planet Taris. It was one of the planet's main exports and commanded a high price. The ale was made from the glands of a tach, and because of the need for this ingredient there were substantial imports of tach glands from Kashyyyk. Consuming just one was enough to intoxicate, or even incapacitate, inexperienced drinkers or even experienced drinkers who were having their first Tarisian ale. -->
  <TarisianAle.description>塔里斯麦酒是一种在塔里斯星球上酿造的烈性酒。它是该星球的主要出口商品之一，价格昂贵。这种麦芽酒是用塔奇人的腺体酿造的，由于对这种原料的需求，从卡希克星球进口了大量塔奇人的腺体。只要喝上一口，就足以让没有喝酒经验的人，甚至是第一次喝塔里西亚麦酒的老手们醉倒，甚至丧失能力。</TarisianAle.description>
